# The repository already tracks a safe .npmrc for pnpm workspace settings.
# Put the registry mapping in the user-level npmrc or let CI generate it, and
# pass the token through the environment. Never commit a real token.
#
# npmjs (private scoped packages):
# @edp:registry=https://registry.npmjs.org/
# //registry.npmjs.org/:_authToken=${NPM_TOKEN}
#
# GitHub Packages (the scope must match the GitHub owner/org):
# @your-github-org:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
# //npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${NODE_AUTH_TOKEN}
